{{Quote|Such power...trapped, held slave by [[Ben Tennyson (Race Against Time Timeline)|a child]]. No longer. I am free!|Eon's first words.}}
'''Eon'''<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Race Against Time Timeline)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="RAT" />{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Repress Ben's Personality.png]]|group = pop-up|name = Beon}}<ref name="RAT" /> was the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Chronian]] from the planet [[Chronia]], prior to the retcon. This transformation was a younger version of [[Eon]] that [[Ben Tennyson (Race Against Time Timeline)|Ben]] was transformed into in '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]'''''.{{Refn|The Chronian transformation was retconned in ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'' when [[Eon]]'s backstory was revised into an alternate version of Ben.{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}}<!--Chronians does not exist in the RAT timeline either.-->

==Appearance==
Being a younger version of [[Eon]], the transformation looks the same as normal Eon, minus the helmet, pale white skin, and bags underneath the eyes. The [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located on the right side of his stomach.

