2Race (638).png|Eon's Omnitrix Symbol Placement
</gallery>

==Powers and Abilities ==
<gallery type="slideshow">
2Race (405).png|Chronokinesis/Dynakinesis
2Race (657).png|Time Rays
2Race (390).png|Energy Ball Generation
2Race (343).png|Enhanced Strength
</gallery>
Eon possesses chronokinesis, which gives him control over time itself; granted by the purple energy that his body emits. Eon channels the energy through his hands, from which he can influence the entire flow of time around him, or on a specific target; allowing him to rapidly age beings, even to dust. He can also project and shoot out that same energy from his hands as time rays, that accelerate whatever they touch.{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Energy Blasts.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT">'''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]'''''</ref>

Eon possesses dynakinesis,{{Refn|[[:File:Chronian Powers.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" /> which allows him to easily control energy. Using his power over energy, Eon is able to create force fields to trap his opponents.<ref name="RAT" /> Eon can also manipulate and control some technology using his dynakinesis, such as vehicles or clockwork gears.{{Refn|[[:File:Eon Control Cars.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" />

Eon also possesses materiokinesis, allowing him to manipulate matter to create illusions and mirages. This enabled Eon's [[Eon|original counterpart]] to fake his death by making it appear that he was burned up by [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]. He can also use telekinesis.<ref name="RAT" />

Eon possesses enhanced strength, as he was able to break free from a chain. Eon possesses enhanced durability, as his original counterpart was able to withstand [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]]'s projectile shards and endure [[Wildmutt]]'s tackle.<ref name="RAT" />

Eon is resistant to fire, as his original counterpart was able to withstand [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]'s attacks.<ref name="RAT" />

Eon is capable of using Cognitive Projection.<ref name="RAT" />

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
File:2Race (465).png|Electricity Vulnerability
</gallery>
If the failsafe that prevents Ben from being in his alien forms for more than 10 minutes is deactivated, his original counterpart's personality will override his own.{{Refn|[[:File:RAT Omnitrix Failsafe Off.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="RAT" />

Multiple leaps through time will cause Eon's body to become pale and weak.<ref>[[Eon]]</ref><ref name="RAT" /> Eon's time rays are also useless against [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapiens]].<ref name="RAT" />

Eon is vulnerable to electricity.<ref name="RAT" />

==History==
===Race Against Time Timeline===
*Eon first appeared in '''''[[Ben 10: Race Against Time]]''''', when the original [[Eon]] forcefully inserted his own DNA into the Omnitrix transforming Ben into a copy of himself and took control of his mind. Young Eon activated the [[Hand of Armageddon|Hands of Armageddon]] before [[Gwen Tennyson (Race Against Time Timeline)|Gwen]] was able to snap Ben back to reality. After willingly reverting back, the transformation was subsequently locked.

